    "https://hro.cityu.edu.mo/en/2026/09/23/faculty-academic-officer-associate-academic-officer/": {
      "title": "Faculty Academic Officer/Associate Academic Officer",
      "description": "Faculty Academic Officer/Associate Academic Officer – 澳門城市大學人事處 Menu Close Our Functions News Open menu News Training Recruitment Activity Job Application Open menu Leader and Management Teaching Administrative Support Job Application Staff Benefits FAQs Contact Us Search for: Search Button Faculty Academic Officer/Associate Academic Officer Responsibility Coordinate the overall daily administrative operations of the faculty, and assist the Dean in formulating annual budgets and related planning; Assist the Dean in coordinating and handling matters related to staff within the faculty; Supervise the work allocation and training of the administrative team, and track progress; Review, formulate, and continuously optimize the faculty’s internal administrative regulations and workflows; Support the administrative and logistical coordination of academic seminars, international exchange activities, and industry-academia collaboration projects within the faculty; Oversee academic and student records-related matters such as course scheduling and selection, admissions interviews, and thesis proposal defenses; Serve as the communication liaison within and outside the faculty, handling inquiries and complaints from staff and students, as well as business exchanges between university departments; Support the faculty’s course declaration, accreditation, and course planning paperwork and process follow-up; Other duties assigned by superiors or the University. Requirement Master’s degree or above (in disciplines such as Psychology/Education; Finance Management, etc.) 9 years or more of work experience; experience in higher education teaching and management is preferred Leadership ability, organizational coordination skills, and decision-making and execution capability A sense of responsibility and teamwork spirit Familiarity with institutional academic administrative systems Fluent in Cantonese, Mandarin, and English; proficient in written Chinese and English Application Interested applicants please register and fill out the application form via the recruitment system: https://career.cityu.edu.mo/Job/Login . *Personal data provided by applicants will be kept confidential and used for recruitment purpose only. Published 2026-9-23 By tong sofia Categorized as Administrative Support Post navigation Previous post CityU Organises “Regulation Refresher Training Series” to Standardise Research Promotion, Management and Evaluation Next post Towards a Healthy Campus: City University of Macau Continues to Launch Employee Assistance Program Contact Room A204, Administrative Building 2F, Avenida Padre Tomás Pereira Taipa, Macau. Tel: +853 2878 1698 Fax: +853 2878 8081 Email: hroinfo@cityu.mo Office Hours Monday to Friday 9:00-12:45 and 13:45-18:00 (Closed on Saturdays,Sundays and Public Holidays) Quick Links Our Functions Job Application Staff Benefits FAQs Contact Us Copyright © 2023 澳門城市大學 - 人事處"
    },
    "https://hro.cityu.edu.mo/en/2026/09/22/senior-clerk-recruitment-business-partner-human-resources-office/": {
      "title": "Senior Clerk (Recruitment & Business Partner)",
      "description": "Senior Clerk (Recruitment & Business Partner) – Human Resources Office – 澳門城市大學人事處 Our Functions News News Training Recruitment Activity Job Application Leader and Management Teaching Administrative Support Job Application Staff Benefits FAQs Contact Us Menu Close Our Functions News Open menu News Training Recruitment Activity Job Application Open menu Leader and Management Teaching Administrative Support Job Application Staff Benefits FAQs Contact Us Search for: Search Button Senior Clerk (Recruitment & Business Partner) – Human Resources Office Job Description Act as a close liaison with various business units to understand and support their human resources needs; Assist in executing the end-to-end recruitment process, including resume screening, interview arrangements, and selection tracking, as well as maintaining and updating the recruitment system; Handle procedures, document signing, and filing related to staff onboarding, contract renewals, promotions, transfers, and offboarding; Assist in handling daily employee relations matters; Assist in optimizing workflows and internal systems; Assist in the day-to-day administrative operations of the HR Office; Perform other tasks and duties as assigned. Requirements Bachelor’s degree or above in Human Resource Management, Administrative Management, or a related field; a Master’s degree is preferred; Minimum of 2 years of relevant work experience, with experience in the education sector preferred; Knowledge of the Labor Relations Law and relevant laws and policies of higher education in Macau; Proficient with Microsoft Office and AI tools to support daily work; Fluent in Cantonese, Mandarin, and English, with proficiency in written Chinese and English; Detail-oriented, responsible, a good team player with excellent communication skills; Mature, well-organized and able to work independently; Macau residents will be given priority consideration. Application Interested applicants please register and fill out the application form via the recruitment system: https://career.cityu.edu.mo/Job/Login . *Personal data provided by applicants will be kept confidential and used for recruitment purpose only. Published 2026-9-22 By tong sofia Categorized as Administrative Support Post navigation Previous post Senior Clerk (Compensation and Benefits) – Human Resources Office Next post CityU Organises “Regulation Refresher Training Series” to Standardise Research Promotion, Management and Evaluation Contact Room A204, Administrative Building 2F, Avenida Padre Tomás Pereira Taipa, Macau. Tel: +853 2878 1698 Fax: +853 2878 8081 Email: hroinfo@cityu.mo Office Hours Monday to Friday 9:00-12:45 and 13:45-18:00 (Closed on Saturdays,Sundays and Public Holidays) Quick Links Our Functions Job Application Staff Benefits FAQs Contact Us Copyright © 2023 澳門城市大學 - 人事處 ."
    },
    "https://hro.cityu.edu.mo/en/2026/09/22/senior-clerk-compensation-and-benefits-human-resources-office/": {
      "title": "Senior Clerk (Compensation and Benefits)",
      "description": "Senior Clerk (Compensation and Benefits) – Human Resources Office – 澳門城市大學人事處 Our Functions News News Training Recruitment Activity Job Application Leader and Management Teaching Administrative Support Job Application Staff Benefits FAQs Contact Us Menu Close Our Functions News Open menu News Training Recruitment Activity Job Application Open menu Leader and Management Teaching Administrative Support Job Application Staff Benefits FAQs Contact Us Search for: Search Button Senior Clerk (Compensation and Benefits) – Human Resources Office Job Description Prepare employment contracts, and process and manage daily overtime, attendance, and leave records; Handle applications, renewals, and cancellations for work visas and residency permits; Handle employee benefits and insurance-related tasks; Assist in optimizing work workflows and internal systems; Assist in the day-to-day administrative operations of the HR Office; Perform other tasks and duties as assigned. Requirement Bachelor’s degree or above, a Master’s degree is preferred; Minimum of 2 years of relevant work experience, with experience in the education sector preferred; Knowledge of the Labor Relations Law and relevant laws and policies of higher education in Macau; Proficient with Microsoft Office and AI tools to support daily work; Fluent in Cantonese, Mandarin, and English, with proficiency in written Chinese and English; Detail-oriented, responsible, a good team player with excellent communication skills; Mature, well-organized and able to work independently; Macau residents will be given priority consideration. Application Interested applicants please register and fill out the application form via the recruitment system: https://career.cityu.edu.mo/Job/Login . *Personal data provided by applicants will be kept confidential and used for recruitment purpose only. Published 2026-9-22 By tong sofia Categorized as Administrative Support Post navigation Previous post Senior Clerk (Asset Management) – General Affairs Office Next post Senior Clerk (Recruitment & Business Partner) – Human Resources Office Contact Room A204, Administrative Building 2F, Avenida Padre Tomás Pereira Taipa, Macau. Tel: +853 2878 1698 Fax: +853 2878 8081 Email: hroinfo@cityu.mo Office Hours Monday to Friday 9:00-12:45 and 13:45-18:00 (Closed on Saturdays,Sundays and Public Holidays) Quick Links Our Functions Job Application Staff Benefits FAQs Contact Us Copyright © 2023 澳門城市大學 - 人事處 ."
