    "https://hro.cityu.edu.mo/en/2026/09/22/senior-clerk-asset-management-general-affairs-office/": {
      "title": "Senior Clerk (Asset Management)",
      "description": "Senior Clerk (Asset Management) – General Affairs Office – 澳門城市大學人事處 Our Functions News News Training Recruitment Activity Job Application Leader and Management Teaching Administrative Support Job Application Staff Benefits FAQs Contact Us Menu Close Our Functions News Open menu News Training Recruitment Activity Job Application Open menu Leader and Management Teaching Administrative Support Job Application Staff Benefits FAQs Contact Us Search for: Search Button Senior Clerk (Asset Management) – General Affairs Office Job Description Assist in asset management, including tasks such as asset recording, transfers, and disposal; Follow up on annual inventory activities; Maintain the fixed asset database; Track material management, including handling souvenir requests, equipment rental requests, and internal office supplies and material management; Assist in data collection, analysis, organization, and statistical reporting for office projects; Execute administrative and logistical support tasks for university events; Perform other tasks and duties as assigned. Requirement Bachelor’s degree or above; Minimum 1 year of relevant work experience, experience in higher education, government, and corporate management preferred; Familiar with Microsoft Office; Fluent in Cantonese, Mandarin, and English, proficient in Chinese and English writing; Organizational and managerial skills, adept at written communication, problem-solving, and good communication skills; Ability to work independently, be responsible, proactive, detail-oriented, handle pressure well, and maintain a high standard of professionalism; Application is open to Macau residents only. Application Interested applicants please register and fill out the application form via the recruitment system: https://career.cityu.edu.mo/Job/Login . *Personal data provided by applicants will be kept confidential and used for recruitment purpose only. Published 2026-9-22 By tong sofia Categorized as Administrative Support Post navigation Previous post CityU Celebrates Mid‑Autumn Festival with Staff Members Next post Senior Clerk (Compensation and Benefits) – Human Resources Office Contact Room A204, Administrative Building 2F, Avenida Padre Tomás Pereira Taipa, Macau. Tel: +853 2878 1698 Fax: +853 2878 8081 Email: hroinfo@cityu.mo Office Hours Monday to Friday 9:00-12:45 and 13:45-18:00 (Closed on Saturdays,Sundays and Public Holidays) Quick Links Our Functions Job Application Staff Benefits FAQs Contact Us Copyright © 2023 澳門城市大學 - 人事處 ."
