    "https://hro.cityu.edu.mo/en/2026/09/15/supervisor-senior-supervisor-administrative-officer-dormitory-management-facility-management-office/": {
      "title": "Supervisor / Senior Supervisor / Administrative Officer (Dormitory Management)",
      "description": "Supervisor / Senior Supervisor / Administrative Officer (Dormitory Management) – Facility Management Office – 澳門城市大學人事處 Our Functions News News Training Recruitment Activity Job Application Leader and Management Teaching Administrative Support Job Application Staff Benefits FAQs Contact Us Menu Close Our Functions News Open menu News Training Recruitment Activity Job Application Open menu Leader and Management Teaching Administrative Support Job Application Staff Benefits FAQs Contact Us Search for: Search Button Supervisor / Senior Supervisor / Administrative Officer (Dormitory Management) – Facility Management Office Job Description Oversee and manage the daily operations of student and staff dormitories; Follow up on the progress of hardware provisions and maintenance for all dormitories; Monitor the use and condition of assets in student and staff dormitories; Process check-in and check-out applications for staff and visitors; Coordinate the work arrangements of dormitory personnel, including wardens, cleaning, and security staff; Organize and carry out security inspections of all dormitories; Assist in preparing the annual budget for dormitories; Assist in conducting fire drills in dormitories and promoting home safety; Coordinate and handle sudden emergencies; Perform other tasks and duties as assigned. Requirements Bachelor’s degree holder or above in Hospitality Management, Property Management, Public Administration or related disciplines; a Master’s degree is preferred; At least 3 years of experience in property/hotel management or dormitory logistics management; experience in building facilities and asset management is preferred; Good cross-departmental coordination skills; Basic knowledge of building facilities; Proficient in word processing software such as Word, Excel, and PowerPoint; Detail-oriented, calm, and able to work independently; Good written Chinese and English; Macau residents will be given priority consideration. Application Interested applicants please register and fill out the application form via the recruitment system: https://career.cityu.edu.mo/Job/Login . *Personal data provided by applicants will be kept confidential and used for recruitment purpose only. Published 2026-9-15 By tong sofia Categorized as Administrative Support Post navigation Previous post Supervisor / Senior Supervisor(International Communications) – Institutional Research and Analytics Next post CityU Celebrates Mid‑Autumn Festival with Staff Members Contact Room A204, Administrative Building 2F, Avenida Padre Tomás Pereira Taipa, Macau. Tel: +853 2878 1698 Fax: +853 2878 8081 Email: hroinfo@cityu.mo Office Hours Monday to Friday 9:00-12:45 and 13:45-18:00 (Closed on Saturdays,Sundays and Public Holidays) Quick Links Our Functions Job Application Staff Benefits FAQs Contact Us Copyright © 2023 澳門城市大學 - 人事處 ."
